abstract: "FAIR-aligned Open Science hub and OSDMP — EXCELLENCE edition — compliant with NASA TOPS SPD-41a (Code Apache-2.0 approved, Data CC-BY-4.0 required), CSA, ESA (CNES, ASI, UKSA, DTU Space, DLR), JAXA, Horizon Europe, UNESCO. Dual-license model with interconnected FAIR files, persistent DOIs via Zenodo/OSF, machine-readable codemeta.json and schema.org."
